Add support for tilde strikethrough and GitHub Flavored Markdown tables. Unlike
with cmark-gfm, these extensions are not toggleable.

**AI Disclosure:**
- **Authorship:** AI-assisted
- **Models:** deepseek-v4.1-flash (DeepSeek)
- **Scope:** Added support for strikethrough with tildes and tables.
- References: https://github.com/github/cmark-gfm (27d942c)

